  (2, 1, 'corporate-structure', 'f_authorized_signatories', 'Authorized Signatories', 'entity_name', 'many', 'Who can bind the entity, as stated in a board resolution, bylaws or mandate. Do NOT include a person who signed only as witness, certifier, notary or registry official.', NULL, 16),
